def test_api_smoke_flow(...):
    Exercise the main API flow through auth, session creation, AI runs, session history, and leaderboard.

    For `game_status`:
    - send owned champion, enemy champion, item, rune, and tower-target context
    - assert the result includes the expected match duration
    - assert the result includes own/enemy hero stat-profile estimates
    - assert the deterministic parameter appendix still includes catalog-backed item details
